{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23805","headline":"送令狐相公赴太原 · 白居易","name":"送令狐相公赴太原","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"六纛双旌万铁衣，幷汾旧路满光辉。\n青衫书记何年去，红斾将军昨日归。\n诗作马蹄随笔走，猎酣鹰翅伴觥飞。\n此都莫作多时计，再爲苍生入紫微。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23805.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23805","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}